// other public headers offer, units aside (beman.inside.units).
//
// The headers stay the source of truth. They are included in the purview
// inside extern "C++", so their entities belong to the global module, as if
// included: a program may #include the headers in one TU and import the
// module in another. Only the names below are exported; detail is not.
// Library macros (BEMAN_INSIDE_MATH_NO_FP & co.) are options of the module's
// build, not of the importing TU.
